---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact and Corrections — Greedy Growers Hub" description="How to prepare corrections and source updates for Greedy Growers Hub." canonicalPath="/contact" noindex>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">Corrections</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-5xl">Contact status</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/[.06] p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-amber-200">No public inbox is published yet.</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-sand-300">This MVP does not collect contact details or accept uploads. A submission channel will be placed on this page when it is ready; no email address has been invented for launch.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Prepare a useful correction</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 text-sand-300"><li class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-4"><strong class="text-sand-100">1. Page:</strong> include the exact page URL.</li><li class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-4"><strong class="text-sand-100">2. Claim:</strong> name the code, seed, value, or instruction that changed.</li><li class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-4"><strong class="text-sand-100">3. Evidence:</strong> include a dated public source or an uncropped in-game screenshot.</li></ul></section>
    <p class="mt-10 leading-7 text-sand-300">For official game support, account issues, purchases, or moderation, use the channels linked from the <a class="text-leaf-400 underline" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/74102906764176/Greedy-Growers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official Roblox experience page</a>. This fan site cannot act on those requests.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
